<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!--
    RUT_Greentide                                  UtinniPatches - authored 2026-09-09
    BIOME_OWNERSHIP_WAVE_1. Full sheet: design/Jawa/worldbuilding/biomes/
    the_greentide.md (FROZEN). Replaces the donor `BiomeCypreJungle` (GRiNDTerra
    Biomes — "Cypre" was the donor's tree name, dies with the eviction).

    MEASURED live on V26 (sheet SS0): 235 tiles, 199 of them river tiles (85%) —
    "no river, no jungle" is the biome in one number. Arc 11.3-58.3 (median 44.7,
    sun +45 deg — extreme-desert energy). Temp median 45.5 C.

    Weather rebuilt around SS4c's "steam kit," NOT the donor's temperate-jungle
    table: donor Clear was 18 (a mild-jungle read); dropped hard, because this is
    "the most furiously productive ground on the planet" under Extreme-Desert sun —
    the Roil (standing ground-hugging hot fog) is the norm, not an event. No
    dedicated Roil/Breaklight/underlight-rain WeatherDefs exist yet (SS Owed,
    `GREENTIDE_MECHANICS_1`) — Fog itself is NOT substituted here (fog reads as
    cool/grey, wrong for a hot steam-jungle) and left at 0 rather than mis-cast;
    flagged as a real gap pending that item. Snow zeroed outright (45 C median makes
    it absurd — not a named ban, a thematic call). GrayPall/Overcast (both
    MayRequire-gated) zeroed to 0 rather than removed, keeping the slots visible for
    whoever authors GREENTIDE_MECHANICS_1's real weather next.

    diseases kept at the donor's own set (diseaseMtbDays 50, "a heavy disease load —
    also accidentally honest" per SS0). animalDensity/plantDensity kept at the
    donor's own 3.5/0.9+ (SS0 explicitly: "animalDensity 3.5... §4 explains why it is
    accidentally right").

    wildAnimals/wildPlants: transplanted from BiomeCast_Ashkarr.xml /
    BiomeFlora_Ashkarr.xml against rosters/the_greentide.json.

    NOT this pass's scope: `GREENTIDE_MECHANICS_1` in full (wet-bulb condition, dry-
    air blower, scald damage + steam devils, Roil/Breaklight/underlight weathers,
    churnmud, causeway map-gen, the Greatbole class); `EXPLOSIVE_PLANT_GROWTH_1`; any
    world repaint.

  -->

  <BiomeDef>
    <defName>RUT_Greentide</defName>
    <label>the Greentide</label>
    <description>A gallery jungle hugging every mile of the rivers that fall off the Scald's rain-peaks -- a green ribbon a few tiles wide through country that gets deep-desert sun, visible from the dunes as a line of steam. The rivers steam all the time; the air holds more water than the river does. Under the steam, everything grows at a speed you can watch, everything eats everything in the open, and the crashing of trees is the background percussion of the place. There is no truce here.</description>
    <workerClass>BiomeWorker_CypreJungle</workerClass>
    <lakeBeachTerrain>Riverbank</lakeBeachTerrain>
    <mudTerrain>CypreJungleMud</mudTerrain>
    <riverbankTerrain>Riverbank</riverbankTerrain>
    <foragedFood>RawBerries</foragedFood>
    <allowRoads>true</allowRoads>
    <allowRivers>true</allowRivers>
    <allowFarmingCamps>true</allowFarmingCamps>
    <animalDensity>3.5</animalDensity>
    <plantDensity>0.9</plantDensity>
    <forageability>1.0</forageability>
    <movementDifficulty>1</movementDifficulty>
    <texture>World/Biomes/Biome_CypreJungle</texture>
    <diseaseMtbDays>50</diseaseMtbDays>
    <diseases>
      <li>
        <diseaseInc>Disease_Flu</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>75</commonality>
      </li>
      <li>
        <diseaseInc>Disease_Plague</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>75</commonality>
      </li>
      <li>
        <diseaseInc>Disease_Malaria</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>75</commonality>
      </li>
      <li>
        <diseaseInc>Disease_GutWorms</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>50</commonality>
      </li>
      <li>
        <diseaseInc>Disease_AnimalFlu</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>75</commonality>
      </li>
      <li>
        <diseaseInc>Disease_AnimalPlague</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>75</commonality>
      </li>
      <li>
        <diseaseInc>Disease_OrganDecay</diseaseInc>
        <commonality>10</commonality>
      </li>
    </diseases>
    <terrainsByFertility>
      <li>
        <terrain>CypreJungleSoil</terrain>
        <min>-999</min>
        <max>0.5</max>
      </li>
      <li>
        <terrain>LightGrass</terrain>
        <min>0.5</min>
        <max>999</max>
      </li>
    </terrainsByFertility>
    <baseWeatherCommonalities>
      <Clear>6</Clear>
      <Fog>0</Fog>
      <Rain>2</Rain>
      <DryThunderstorm>0.3</DryThunderstorm>
      <RainyThunderstorm>1.7</RainyThunderstorm>
      <FoggyRain>1</FoggyRain>
      <SnowGentle>0</SnowGentle>
      <SnowHard>0</SnowHard>
      <GrayPall MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Anomaly">0</GrayPall>
      <Overcast MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Odyssey">0</Overcast>
      <TorrentialRain>0</TorrentialRain>
    </baseWeatherCommonalities>
    <wildAnimals>
